										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791475292422_762932533852784879_585062631125146566", {"feature":"762932533852784879","feature2":"585062631125146566","owner":"103582791475292422","commentthreadid":"658780292","total_count":47,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":34952470,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":3948460,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"585062631125164605":{"text":"Except it doesn't 'steal' anything as there's nothing being generated and it's not a search engine.","author":"JolanXBL"},"585062631125165844":{"text":"Nah, the entire thing is plagiarism based, all of the chatbot garbage slop has been trained on other people's work, you can't get around it, I'm glad it's bankrupting the devs to make this garbage.","author":"Heavens Blade"},"585062631125166169":{"text":"Students at schools are also trained on other people's work, and libraries contain photocopiers without a security guard next to it. If this use is so illegal, you should report it to Steam and your local government.","author":"JolanXBL"},"585062631125166958":{"text":"Yeah that's not the same thing and you know it.  Enjoy your weirdo ai psychosis I guess.","author":"Heavens Blade"},"585062631125204827":{"text":"[quote=Heavens Blade;585062631125166958]Yeah that's not the same thing and you know it.  Enjoy your weirdo ai psychosis I guess. [\/quote]\n\n\nThere's only one person i see exhibiting symptoms of psychosis and its not Jolan.","author":"JiggleBill"},"574929704291710616":{"text":"Downloading the demo just to drive the dev deeper into debt with zero intention to buy the game!","author":"Reptiloid"},"574929704291713439":{"text":"Doing the lords work.","author":"Heavens Blade"},"574929704291713768":{"text":"[quote=JolanXBL;585062631125166169]Students at schools are also trained on other people's work, and libraries contain photocopiers without a security guard next to it. If this use is so illegal, you should report it to Steam and your local government. [\/quote]\n\nYou know schools pay a lot for those books etc right? money that goes to those that made them?","author":"Clowndette"},"574929704291716516":{"text":"[quote=Clowndette;574929704291713768][quote=JolanXBL;585062631125166169]Students at schools are also trained on other people's work, and libraries contain photocopiers without a security guard next to it. If this use is so illegal, you should report it to Steam and your local government. [\/quote]\n\nYou know schools pay a lot for those books etc right? money that goes to those that made them? [\/quote]\nOh sweet summer child","author":"Black N whitE"},"574929704291746920":{"text":"Luddite detected. Opinion denied.","author":"Walpurgisnacht"},"574929704291748773":{"text":"Lol  No, your brain is just mush dude.","author":"Heavens Blade"},"574929704291752041":{"text":"\"plagiarism machine.\"\n\nbrainlet detected","author":"mr.matrix300"},"574929704291755809":{"text":"[quote=mr.matrix300;574929704291752041]\"plagiarism machine.\"\n\nbrainlet detected [\/quote]\n\n\nThe call is coming from inside your own house bro.","author":"Heavens Blade"},"574929704291815816":{"text":"[quote=Dynamo;574929704291776729]people when someone has fun [\/quote]\nyour \"fun\" comes at the expense of others and the environment","author":"Speed Weed"},"574929704291840848":{"text":"[quote=Speed Weed;574929704291815816] mah environment [\/quote]\n\nyou do realize computers and servers use energy and precious metals too?","author":"mr.matrix300"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
